# Extended regexes (one per line) matched against every install-name
# reference reported by `otool -L` for every Mach-O file in the runtime
# tree. @rpath/@loader_path references must resolve inside runtime/lib and
# are checked separately. Homebrew (/opt/homebrew, /usr/local), build
# prefixes, and developer-machine paths are rejected by omission.
^/usr/lib/
^/System/Library/
